{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f9256cc875c05734f326a56d468366c2dde7773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = \\frac{s}{(1 + k)^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"105\" height=\"37\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/3/f33842f9ec585ac96079a2958999df2f1576d37d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{\\log{\\left(\\frac{s}{P}\\right)}}{\\log{(1 + k)}}\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\log{\\left(\\frac{s}{P(1 + k)}\\right)}\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\log{\\left(\\frac{s - P}{1 + k}\\right)}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\log{\\left(\\frac{s}{P}\\right)} + \\log{(1 + k)}\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{\\log{(s)}}{\\log{(P(1 + k))}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"486\" height=\"90\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa949293e2c9d673b8207d0ffafed7a26c165edd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P=\\frac{s}{(1+k)^n}\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/865792d594fcb28f9fa40a0f0a6f81a1a2ecab78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1+k)^n=\\frac{s}{P}\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>Take the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/698c1c9cde3469a346091405ffbbcedf96609562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"16\" /> of each side.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/8/9d82f2f5be7a5b25b973e0064949358bdfc653b3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n \\log(1+k) = \\log\\left(\\frac{s}{P}\\right)\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e39a69e3b1cc48a024e6349ad46f82ba8d1479ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = \\frac{\\log\\left(\\frac{s}{P}\\right)}{\\log(1+k)} \\to \\boxed{\\text{(A)}}\\]\" width=\"183\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"